_:nfe6cc2e873a84976acc3eebd4694c898b5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A reference rml:reference is used to refer to a column in case of \n        databases, a record in case of CSV or TSV data source, an element in \n        case of XML data source, an object in case of a JSON data source, etc.\n\n        A reference must be a valid identifier, considering the reference \n        formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) specified. The reference can be\n        an absolute path, or a path relative to the iterator specified at the \n        logical source. \n        " .
_:n72825f76e7eb47a8b02497f1dc88b4eab14 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/baseIRI> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:n2387b59ae3674226ab4ce60557ea5b83b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/WriteRead> .
_:n553d33d0013e41ac9c11454285a54f54b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n63930492f94141b5bf6853996437355cb9 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Language tag for the object.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Predicate Map.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:nf58bdced73944d669ed042bb6485f067b1 .
_:nc8f07ba62a734689809998c020af322db7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "allowEmptyListAndContainer" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractExpressionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Expression Map must have one of rml:template, rml:constant, or\n    rml:reference, unless rml:termType is rml:BlankNode with no expression.\n    " .
_:nc8f07ba62a734689809998c020af322db2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "gatherAs" .
_:ne90b33944a804235b0a6ba23fa822c8eb16 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:N267a3877318649e99a83bdcd1f5c6047 .
_:n72825f76e7eb47a8b02497f1dc88b4eab6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:n72825f76e7eb47a8b02497f1dc88b4eab3 .
_:n3021ea01ac2f4fc19c4ade168b562500b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:encoding must be provided as an IRI.\n        " .
_:nf58bdced73944d669ed042bb6485f067b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The source (rml:source) locates the input data source. It is a URI\n        that represents the data source where the data source is.\n        " .
_:n553d33d0013e41ac9c11454285a54f54b8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n553d33d0013e41ac9c11454285a54f54b9 .
_:nf5d576412ab84615aca46d34dcb97bc2b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:mode must be specified by any of the modes from rml:Mode class.\n        " .
_:n986d7f26d3c04bf2ad4f32eba941a675b3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rml:logicalTarget" .
_:nc8f07ba62a734689809998c020af322db8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        one or more rml:gather properties are needed, each pointing to a\n        RML Term Map.\n        " .
