_:n986d7f26d3c04bf2ad4f32eba941a675b3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A Term Map MAY contain one or more rml:logicalTarget properties to\n        export all triples containing the generated term to different\n        targets.\n        " .
